# Google C++ Style Guide, applied to every first-party C and C++ file.
# https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html
# clang-format's Google preset is that guide's formatting subset
# (2-space indent, 80 columns, pointers and references on the left,
# braces attached).
#
# Includes are not reordered. Translation units define configuration
# macros immediately before the headers that consume them.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++17
LineEnding: LF
SortIncludes: Never
InsertBraces: true
...
